  "metaRegistry": "https://w3id.org/ogc/bblocks/meta-register.json",
  "name": "Building Blocks - Routes demo register",
  "abstract": "A tiny demo register with one building block: a data model for routes.\n",
  "description": "Created from the [OGC building block template](https://github.com/opengeospatial/bblock-template)\nto show how a new building block is defined, documented and tested. It reuses the OGC feature model.\n",
